{
  "html": "<div id=\"main\" class=\"b-main\"><div class=\"b-page-heading\"><div><span class=\"b-eyebrow\">SUGAR RUNES / CRAFT & PLAN</span><h1><span class=\"r-title-icon\" data-ui-icon=\"runes.SSR\"></span>Sugar Runes <small class=\"r-title-label\">Planner</small></h1><p>Equip Sugar Runes, lock the effects you want, then plan crafting attempts and Rune Crystals.</p></div><a class=\"b-button b-button-light\" href=\"/data/tools/tables/SugarRunePiecePools.json\" download>Detailed effect probabilities ↗</a></div>\r\n<p id=\"rune-loading\" class=\"b-note\" role=\"status\">Loading Sugar Rune configuration…</p>\r\n<div id=\"rune-tool\" hidden>\r\n<section class=\"r-workbench\"><div class=\"r-game-top\"><div><span data-ui-icon=\"sectionIcon\"></span><h2>Craft Runes</h2><span class=\"r-local-label\">Local planner</span></div><div class=\"r-crystal-counter\"><span data-ui-icon=\"currency\"></span><span>Per craft<strong id=\"rune-live-cost\">20</strong></span></div></div>\r\n<section class=\"r-setup\"><div class=\"r-character\"><img id=\"rune-character-art\" alt=\"\"><div><h2 id=\"rune-character-name\"></h2><a id=\"rune-character-link\" href=\"/cookies/\">Cookie details ↗</a></div></div><div class=\"r-fields\"><label><span class=\"r-field-caption\"><img id=\"rune-character-label-art\" class=\"r-field-icon\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\">Choose Cookie</span><select id=\"rune-character\" aria-label=\"Sugar Rune Cookie\"></select></label><label><span class=\"r-field-caption\"><span class=\"r-field-icon\" data-ui-icon=\"slot\"></span>Active slots</span><select id=\"rune-grade\" aria-label=\"Active Sugar Rune slots\"></select></label></div><div class=\"r-state-counts\"><span><b id=\"rune-open-count\">—</b> / 8 active</span><span><span data-ui-icon=\"lock\"></span><b id=\"rune-locked-count\">—</b> locked</span><span><span data-ui-icon=\"runes.default\"></span><b id=\"rune-roll-count\">—</b> to craft</span></div></section>\r\n<div class=\"r-game-grid\"><section class=\"r-scene\" aria-label=\"Sugar Rune wheel\"><div class=\"r-wheel\"><img class=\"r-wheel-back\" data-ui-image=\"backdrop\" alt=\"\"><img class=\"r-wheel-star\" data-ui-image=\"slot\" alt=\"\"><img id=\"rune-board-character\" class=\"r-board-character\" alt=\"\"><div id=\"rune-wheel-pieces\"></div><button id=\"rune-rotate-left\" class=\"r-wheel-turn turn-left\" aria-label=\"Rotate Rune wheel left\" type=\"button\"><span data-ui-icon=\"controls.rotateLeft\"></span></button><button id=\"rune-rotate-right\" class=\"r-wheel-turn turn-right\" aria-label=\"Rotate Rune wheel right\" type=\"button\"><span data-ui-icon=\"controls.rotateRight\"></span></button></div><div class=\"r-scene-caption\"><strong id=\"rune-selected-label\">Select a Rune slot</strong><span>Select a Rune to view and edit its effect</span></div><div class=\"r-scene-buttons\"><a href=\"#rune-controls\"><span data-ui-icon=\"controls.settings\"></span>Target settings</a><button id=\"rune-calculate\" class=\"r-craft-button\" type=\"button\"><span data-ui-icon=\"currency\"></span>View crafting plan</button></div><div class=\"r-scene-foot\"><span data-ui-icon=\"lock\"></span>Locked effects stay. Locks in all 8 slots affect cost; only active effects add bonuses.</div></section>\r\n<section class=\"r-slot-panel\"><div class=\"r-slot-list-header\"><h3>Rune effects</h3><div class=\"r-mini-actions\"><button id=\"rune-lock-targets\" type=\"button\" title=\"Lock current matching effects\"><span data-ui-icon=\"lock\"></span><span>Lock matches</span></button><button id=\"rune-clear-slots\" type=\"button\" title=\"Clear current effects\"><span data-ui-icon=\"controls.reset\"></span><span>Clear</span></button></div></div><div id=\"rune-slots\" class=\"r-slots\"></div><p id=\"rune-reset-note\" class=\"b-note\"></p></section></div></section>\r\n<section class=\"r-totals\"><h3>Current total bonuses</h3><div id=\"rune-totals\"></div><p class=\"b-note\">Totals group matching effects from Sugar Runes only; they do not simulate final Cookie combat stats.</p></section>\r\n<div class=\"r-planner-layout\"><section class=\"r-controls\" id=\"rune-controls\"><h2><span data-ui-icon=\"controls.settings\"></span>Set crafting targets</h2>\r\n<label class=\"r-rarity-label\"><span class=\"r-field-caption\"><span id=\"rune-rarity-label-icon\" class=\"r-field-icon r-field-grade\" data-ui-icon=\"controls.rarityBadges.SSR\"></span>Minimum rarity</span> <small>Selected rarity or higher</small></label><div id=\"rune-rarity-options\" class=\"r-rarity-options\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Minimum target rarity\"></div><select id=\"rune-rarity\" aria-label=\"Minimum target rarity\" hidden><option value=\"SSR\">SSR</option><option value=\"SR\">SR or higher</option><option value=\"R\">R or higher</option><option value=\"U\">U or higher</option><option value=\"C\">All rarities</option></select><label class=\"r-goal-field\"><span class=\"r-field-caption\"><span class=\"r-field-icon\" data-ui-icon=\"runes.default\"></span>Target effect count</span><select id=\"rune-goal\" aria-label=\"Target effect count\"></select></label>\r\n<fieldset class=\"r-effects\"><legend><span class=\"r-field-caption\"><span class=\"r-field-icon\" data-ui-icon=\"sectionIcon\"></span>Target effects</span> <small>Up to 3 types · Leave empty for any effect<br>Any selected type counts; you do not need every type.</small></legend><div id=\"rune-effect-options\"></div></fieldset>\r\n<label class=\"r-threshold\"><span class=\"r-field-caption\"><span id=\"rune-min-icon\" class=\"r-field-icon\" data-ui-icon=\"runes.default\"></span>Minimum value for one effect <small id=\"rune-min-unit\"></small></span><input id=\"rune-minimum\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"Empty = any value\" aria-label=\"Minimum target effect value\"><small id=\"rune-min-note\">Choose one effect to set a minimum. Count and value targets are planner features; in-game auto-crafting stops when one unlocked effect meets the rarity and any chosen effect.</small></label>\r\n<div class=\"r-fields\"><label><span class=\"r-field-caption\"><span class=\"r-field-icon\" data-ui-icon=\"currency\"></span>Crystal budget</span><input id=\"rune-budget\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"1000000000000\" step=\"1\" value=\"10000\" aria-label=\"Rune Crystal budget\"></label><label><span class=\"r-field-caption\"><span class=\"r-field-icon\" data-ui-icon=\"sectionIcon\"></span>Planned crafts</span><input id=\"rune-attempts\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"5000\" step=\"1\" value=\"100\" aria-label=\"Planned crafts\"></label></div>\r\n<label class=\"r-strategy\"><span class=\"r-field-caption\"><span class=\"r-field-icon\" data-ui-icon=\"lock\"></span>Crafting strategy</span><select id=\"rune-strategy\" aria-label=\"Sugar Rune crafting strategy\"><option value=\"fixed\">Fixed locks · Keep the same slots</option><option value=\"keep\">Keep matches · Lock new matches</option></select></label>\r\n<p id=\"rune-strategy-note\" class=\"b-note\"></p>\r\n<label><span class=\"r-field-caption\"><span class=\"r-field-icon\" data-ui-icon=\"currency\"></span>Total active discount (%)</span><input id=\"rune-discount\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"10000\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Total active discount\"><small>Enter the sum of active discounts. Default: none. Check your active account bonuses in-game.</small></label><label class=\"r-manual-check\"><input id=\"rune-manual\" type=\"checkbox\">Use the cost shown in-game</label><label id=\"rune-manual-field\" hidden><span class=\"r-field-caption\"><span class=\"r-field-icon\" data-ui-icon=\"currency\"></span>Actual cost per craft</span><input id=\"rune-manual-cost\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"1000000000\" step=\"1\" value=\"20\" aria-label=\"Manual Crystal cost per craft\"></label><p id=\"rune-cost-note\" class=\"b-note\"></p>\r\n<div class=\"r-save-actions\"><button class=\"b-button\" id=\"rune-save\" type=\"button\">Save Cookie plan</button><button class=\"b-button b-button-light\" id=\"rune-share\" type=\"button\">Copy plan link</button></div><label id=\"rune-share-field\" hidden>Plan link<input id=\"rune-share-url\" type=\"text\" readonly aria-label=\"Sugar Rune plan link\"></label><p id=\"rune-save-note\" class=\"b-note\">Plans stay in this browser. Copy a link to share these settings.</p></section>\r\n<section class=\"r-results\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"b-section-head\"><h2>Crafting forecast</h2><span class=\"b-tag\">Configured weight model</span></div><div id=\"rune-result\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"r-source-note\"><strong>Model assumptions</strong><p>Weights are normalized across the current pool, assuming independent slots and crafts. Targets and bonuses use active slots; all 8 slots count toward lock fees. Two recorded manual crafts showed inactive slots generating/updating and retaining locked effects, but do not prove independence. Results are planning estimates, not guarantees. Keep matches simulates manual locking, rather than in-game auto-crafting.</p></div></section></div>\r\n<section class=\"b-section\"><div class=\"b-section-head\"><div><h2>Target outcomes and crafting rules</h2><p id=\"rune-pool-summary\"></p></div><a href=\"/data/tools/tables/SugarRunePiecePools.csv\" download>Download original effect pool CSV ↓</a></div><div class=\"r-reference-grid\"><section><h3>Slot unlocks and lock costs</h3><div class=\"b-table-wrap\" id=\"rune-rules\"></div></section><section><h3>Single-slot rarity weights</h3><div class=\"b-table-wrap\" id=\"rune-rarity-table\"></div><p class=\"b-note\">Weights are normalized across the full pool, rather than redistributed among selected targets.</p></section></div><div class=\"r-distribution\"><h3>Outcomes matching your target</h3><p id=\"rune-match-count\" class=\"b-note\"></p><div class=\"b-table-wrap\" id=\"rune-outcomes\"></div></div><details class=\"b-raw\"><summary>Sources and rule limits</summary><div id=\"rune-evidence\" class=\"b-note\"></div><p class=\"b-note\">Checked against the official table on 2026-10-16: all 160 probabilities match at six decimal places, along with 160 effect values and 14 units. Mov SPD and Skill Haste are flat values; the others are percentages.<a href=\"https://cs-cookieruncrumble.devsisters.com/hc/zh-tw/articles/60508500007449-%E7%B3%96%E7%AC%A6%E6%96%87-%E8%A3%9D%E5%82%99%E7%9B%A4%E5%BC%B7%E5%8C%96%E6%A9%9F%E7%8E%87%E8%A9%B3%E6%83%85\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Official probability notes ↗</a> · <a href=\"/data/tools/verification/official-sugar-plate-comparison-20261016.json\" download>Item-by-item comparison ↓</a></p><a href=\"/data/tools/tables/SugarRuneRerollCosts.json\" download>Download lock costs JSON</a> · <a href=\"/data/tools/tables/SugarRuneSlots.json\" download>Download slot rules JSON</a></details></section>\r\n</div></div><div id=\"book-toast\" class=\"b-toast\" role=\"status\" hidden></div>"
}
